{"id": "3002298", "name": "מד\"ר הומוגנית מסדר 4 – ורונסקיאן בנקודה מערכו בנקודה אחרת (אבל)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_1(x),y_2(x),y_3(x),y_4(x)\\)</span> הם 4 פתרונות של המד\"ר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y^{(4)}+{{CT:0}}\\cdot y'''+{{CT:1}}\\cdot y''+{{CT:2}}\\cdot y'+{{CT:3}}\\cdot y=0 \\]</p><p>ידוע כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W[y_1,y_2,y_3,y_4]({{CT:4}})={{CT:5}}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W[y_1,y_2,y_3,y_4]({{CT:6}})\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(W[y_1,y_2,y_3,y_4]({{CT:6}})= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בנוסחת אבל, שקובעת את הוורונסקיאן לפי המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y'''\\)</span> בלבד.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — נוסחת אבל</b><br>עבור מד\"ר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y^{(4)}+p_3(x)y'''+\\dots+p_0(x)y=0\\)</span> עם מקדמים רציפים בקטע, הוורונסקיאן של כל ארבעה פתרונות מקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W'=-p_3\\,W\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ W(x)=W(x_0)\\,e^{-\\int_{x_0}^{x}p_3(s)\\,ds} \\]</p>כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p_3(x)={{CT:0}}\\)</span>, והמקדמים רציפים בקטע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x&gt;0\\)</span>, שמכיל את שתי הנקודות.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האינטגרל</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_{ {{CT:4}} }^{ {{CT:6}} }{{CT:0}}\\,dx={{CT:7}}\\ln\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:4}} } \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ e^{-\\int p_3}=\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:4}} }\\right)^{-{{CT:7}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — התוצאה</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ W({{CT:6}})={{CT:5}}\\cdot\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:4}} }\\right)^{-{{CT:7}}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "W1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["W0", "W1", "a0", "a1", "a2", "a3", "p0", "p1", "p2", "p3", "x0", "x1"], "nvariants": 50}